{"branch":"돈암점","html":"<p class=\"kd-intro\">돈암점의 위치와 주변 교통편을 확인하세요.</p><div class=\"kd-map-slot\" data-kakao-src=\"/assets/kakao-directions/map-6132480b581d6d1d.html\" style=\"height:398px\"><p class=\"kd-map-pending\" role=\"status\">위치 지도를 준비하고 있습니다.</p><template><iframe class=\"kd-map-frame\" width=\"640\" height=\"398\" style=\"height:398px\" loading=\"lazy\" sandbox=\"allow-scripts\" referrerpolicy=\"strict-origin-when-cross-origin\" title=\"돈암점 카카오맵 지도\" src=\"/assets/kakao-directions/map-6132480b581d6d1d.html\"></iframe></template></div><noscript><style>.kd-map-slot{display:none}</style><p class=\"kd-note\">위의 지도 이미지와 아래 주소를 기준으로 위치를 확인해 주세요.</p></noscript><p class=\"kd-address\"><strong>주소</strong><span>서울 성북구 동소문로 190 중앙빌딩 201호</span></p><div class=\"kd-transport\"><h3>주변 지하철</h3><ul class=\"kd-items\"><li><span class=\"kd-line\">수도권 4호선</span><span>길음역</span></li><li><span class=\"kd-line\">수도권 4호선</span><span>성신여대입구역</span></li><li><span class=\"kd-line\">우이신설</span><span>성신여대입구역</span></li><li><span class=\"kd-line\">우이신설</span><span>정릉역</span></li></ul></div><div class=\"kd-transport\"><h3>주변 정류장</h3><ol class=\"kd-items\"><li><span class=\"kd-number\">1</span><span>미아리고개.미아리예술극장</span></li><li><span class=\"kd-number\">2</span><span>미아리고개.미아리예술극장</span></li><li><span class=\"kd-number\">3</span><span>풍림106동</span></li><li><span class=\"kd-number\">4</span><span>고명중고교</span></li><li><span class=\"kd-number\">5</span><span>풍림아파트</span></li><li><span class=\"kd-number\">6</span><span>고명중고교</span></li></ol></div><div class=\"kd-transport\"><h3>주변 버스</h3><dl class=\"kd-buses\"><div><dt><span class=\"kd-bus-type\">간선</span></dt><dd><span>100</span><span>102</span><span>103</span><span>104</span><span>107</span><span>109</span><span>140</span><span>142</span><span>143</span><span>150</span><span>151</span><span>152</span><span>160</span><span>171</span><span>172</span><span>710</span><span>N15(심야)</span><span>N16(심야)</span><span>새벽A160(자율주행)(토,일 미운행)</span>